{"id":"611563","name":"紫薯糯米团","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/611563/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫薯","amount":"一个"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葡萄干","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"紫薯去皮切块，上锅蒸熟。","img":"images/611563/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"压成泥。","img":"images/611563/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红枣、葡萄干洗净。","img":"images/611563/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"红枣去核，切碎。","img":"images/611563/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"糯米粉准备好。","img":"images/611563/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"所有食材放在一起。","img":"images/611563/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"合成一个糯米面团。","img":"images/611563/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"整理成窝头形状。","img":"images/611563/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"粘上一层糯米粉。","img":"images/611563/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"冷水上锅，大火烧开转中火蒸15分钟。","img":"images/611563/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/611563/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"甜甜的、糯糯的非常好吃。","img":"images/611563/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}